###Block: Appendix A -- New Feats, Spells and Class Features
Augment Creature	KEY:Discovery ~ Augment Creature	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AlchemistDiscovery.SpecialQuality	PREVARGTEQ:DiscoveryQualifyLVL,12	DESC:Using a combination of magical and technological methods, the alchemist can grant a corporeal creature the augmented template. The augmented creature owes its creator no special loyalty. The alchemist must be at least 12th level to select this discovery.	SOURCEPAGE:p.298
Manimal Elixir	KEY:Discovery ~ Manimal Elixir	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AlchemistDiscovery.SpecialQuality	PREVARGTEQ:DiscoveryQualifyLVL,12	DESC:The alchemist can make an elixir that, fed to an animal, grants it the manimal template. The alchemist must be at least 12th level to select this discovery.	SOURCEPAGE:p.298
Shrinking Serum	KEY:Discovery ~ Shrinking Serum	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AlchemistDiscovery.SpecialQuality	PREVARGTEQ:DiscoveryQualifyLVL,8	DESC:The alchemist can make a concoction that shrinks the drinker, granting the miniature template. The alchemist must be at least 8th level to select this discovery.	SOURCEPAGE:p.298
The Teratocephalos Process	KEY:Discovery ~ The Teratocephalos Process	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AlchemistDiscovery.SpecialQuality	PREVARGTEQ:DiscoveryQualifyLVL,12	DESC:The alchemist can make a series of concoctions, salves and powders that let him transplant the head of an animal or humanoid onto another animal or humanoid. The creature receiving the head gains the teratocephalos template; the creature that donated the head dies. The alchemist must be at least 12th level to select this discovery.	SOURCEPAGE:p.298
Verminoid Powder	KEY:Discovery ~ Verminoid Powder	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AlchemistDiscovery.SpecialQuality	PREVARGTEQ:DiscoveryQualifyLVL,12	DESC:The alchemist can make a coarse powder that, fed to a mindless vermin, grants it the verminoid template. The alchemist must be at least 12th level to select this discovery.	SOURCEPAGE:p.298

